    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "检索增强生成（Retrieval-Augmented Generation，RAG）是一种结合了信息检索和文本生成的 AI 技术框架。它通过从外部知识库中检索相关文档片段，然后将这些片段作为上下文提供给大语言模型，从而生成更准确、更相关的回答。",
      "metadata": {},
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "核心功能",
      "metadata": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "1. 文档解析",
      "metadata": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "RAG 系统支持多种文档格式的解析：\n- PDF 文档：支持横排和竖排文字、表格、图表标题提取\n- Word 文档（.docx, .doc）：保留文档结构和格式\n- 纯文本文件（.txt）：支持多种编码自动检测\n- Markdown 文件（.md, .markdown）：解析标题、表格、代码块等元素",
      "metadata": {},
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "2. 文本分块策略",
      "metadata": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "分块策略是 RAG 系统的关键环节：\n- 可配置大小：默认 512 tokens，可根据需求调整\n- 句子边界保护：避免在句子中间切分，保持语义完整性\n- 重叠机制：相邻块之间有 50 tokens 的重叠，确保上下文连贯\n- 表格特殊处理：表格按行分组，表头重复出现在每个分块中",
      "metadata": {},
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "3. Embedding 生成",
      "metadata": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "系统支持两种 Embedding 方案：\n- OpenAI Embedding：使用 text-embedding-ada-002 模型，维度 1536\n- 本地 Embedding：使用 sentence-transformers，支持本地部署的模型",
      "metadata": {},
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "4. 向量存储",
      "metadata": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "支持两种向量数据库后端：\n- Chroma：轻量级本地向量数据库，适合开发和小规模部署\n- Milvus：高性能分布式向量数据库，适合生产环境大规模部署",
      "metadata": {},
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "5. 重排序机制",
      "metadata": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "使用 cross-encoder 模型进行两阶段检索：\n1. 粗排：向量检索召回 Top 50 结果\n2. 精排：cross-encoder 精细排序后返回 Top 5 结果",
      "metadata": {},
      "page_number": null,
      "bounding_box": null,
      "text_direction": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "6. 多文件协调",
